  seed   plain ../    : HTTP 400  not_found   <- seed BLOCKED (differential precondition)
  bypass nested ....//: HTTP 200  CANARY-HIT   <- residual CONFIRMED (flag exfiltrated)
  normal GET /canary.txt : HTTP 404

## V2 = frangoteam/fuxa:1.2.11 (port 39612) — fully fixed (normalizeRelativePath/resolveWithin)
